---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="TERMS OF SERVICE // DJ TOBINN">
  <main class="w-full min-h-screen bg-[#050505] text-white py-24 sm:py-32 px-6 sm:px-12 flex flex-col gap-16 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    
    <div class="border-b border-white/20 pb-8 flex flex-col items-start gap-8">
      <a href="/" class="font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white/50 border border-white/20 px-4 py-2 hover:bg-white hover:text-black hover:border-white transition-all">
        < RETURN TO MAIN
      </a>
      <h1 class="display-text text-5xl sm:text-7xl uppercase tracking-tighter leading-[0.8] m-0">TERMS & CONDITIONS</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="font-sans font-bold text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed tracking-wider uppercase text-white/60 flex flex-col gap-12">
      
      <section class="flex flex-col gap-4">
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tighter">1. GENERAL AGREEMENT</h2>
        <p>
          BY ACCESSING THIS WEBSITE AND UTILIZING OUR BOOKING SERVICES, YOU AGREE TO BE BOUND BY THESE TERMS AND CONDITIONS. IF YOU DO NOT AGREE TO THESE TERMS, DISCONNECT IMMEDIATELY.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-4">
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tighter">2. BOOKING PROTOCOL</h2>
        <p>
          ALL BOOKING INQUIRIES ARE SUBJECT TO AVAILABILITY, SCHEDULING, AND FINAL CONFIRMATION BY MANAGEMENT. AN INQUIRY CONSTITUTES A REQUEST, NOT A BINDING CONTRACT. CONTRACTS ARE ONLY VALID ONCE FORMALLY SIGNED AND APPLICABLE DEPOSITS ARE CLEARED.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-4">
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tighter">3. INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY</h2>
        <p>
          ALL AUDIO, BRANDING, LOGOS, AND TYPOGRAPHIC STRUCTURES DISPLAYED ON THIS SITE ARE THE INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY OF DJ TOBINN. UNAUTHORIZED REPRODUCTION, REDISTRIBUTION, OR COMMERCIAL EXPLOITATION IS STRICTLY PROHIBITED.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-4">
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tighter">4. LIMITATION OF LIABILITY</h2>
        <p>
          WE ARE NOT LIABLE FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, OR INCIDENTAL DAMAGES ARISING FROM THE USE OF THIS WEBSITE, UNAVAILABILITY OF SERVICES, OR INTERACTION WITH THIRD-PARTY EMBEDS.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-t border-white/20 pt-12">
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tighter">LAST_UPDATE</h2>
        <p>THESE TERMS WERE LAST MODIFIED IN 2026. WE RESERVE THE RIGHT TO UPDATE THESE TERMS AT ANY TIME WITHOUT PRIOR NOTICE.</p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
